      "candidate": "**Repaired scraper configuration (JSON)**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"gpu-price-scraper\",\n  \"description\": \"Extract GPU product details \u2013 produces gpu-price-schema-v1\",\n  \"base_url\": \"https://example.test\",\n  \"start_urls\": [\"https://example.test/gpu-1\"],\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"product\",\n      \"css_selectors\": [\n        {\n          \"field\": \"product_id\",\n          \"selector\": \"h1[data-product-id]\",\n          \"attribute\": \"data-product-id\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"field\": \"name\",\n          \"selector\": \"h2.product-name\",\n          \"attribute\": \"text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"field\": \"price\",\n          \"selector\": \"span[data-price]\",\n          \"attribute\": \"data-price\",\n          \"type\": \"float\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"field\": \"rating\",\n          \"selector\": \"div.stars\",\n          \"attribute\": \"data-rating\",\n          \"type\": \"float\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"field\": \"url\",\n          \"selector\": \"link[rel=canonical]\",\n          \"attribute\": \"href\",\n          \"default\": \"$base_url\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"output_schema\": \"gpu-price-schema-v1\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Explanation of changes**\n\n1. **Field rename** \u2013 The schema expects the product title under the key `name`.  \n   The selector now extracts the text from `h2.product-name` and maps it to the `name` field.\n\n2. **Robust price extraction** \u2013 The price is now pulled from the `data-price` attribute of `span[data-price]`.  \n   Using the `type: \"float\"` conversion ensures numeric values in the schema.\n\n3. **Explicit rating source** \u2013 Rating is extracted from the `data-rating` attribute of `div.stars`, guaranteeing the rating value is captured even if the visual star markup changes.\n\n4. **Canonical URL** \u2013 The `url` field now falls back to the page\u2019s canonical URL (`link[rel=canonical]`), ensuring the `url` field is always present and consistent.  \n\nThese adjustments restore the scraper\u2019s ability to emit data that matches the `gpu-price-schema-v1` structure."
